// ClassReflectionOwnNameSubActor — test fixture for BT-4423
//
// Inherits `ClassReflectionCascadeOwnNameActor`'s class methods and declares
// its own `total` (class variables are per class, ADR 0130). In an inherited
// method, `self` is this class, while the parent's name is always the parent:
// `namedRead` reads the parent's `total`, `cascadeRead` this class's.

ClassReflectionCascadeOwnNameActor subclass: ClassReflectionOwnNameSubActor
  classState: total :: Integer = 100
  classState: extra
